      <description>&lt;p&gt;We have started a weekly Numerical/Theoretical Journal Club, organized by Caitlin Doughty and Fernando Hidalgo-Pineda. The club meets every Monday, 14:00–14:30 in the library lounge of ARI. Sessions are informal; everyone is welcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be added to the mailing list, for questions or to suggest papers, contact the organizers.&lt;/p&gt;
